  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Data & Quality evidence",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "No evidence",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Data & Quality · Acceptance evidence\nThis page reads the published corpus report and its SHA-256 companion. [Acquisition](/d/tradebot-acquisition) records raw diagnostic history; a research-eligible dataset needs an immutable selection with source hashes, exclusions and acceptance records.\n\nA successful independent rebuild establishes reproducibility of the selected sample. Tick-quality failures, dated calendar coverage, the liquid-hours criterion, reference checks and approvals remain separate. Missing evidence stays unknown."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Published report",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Reads the report path selected when the exporter was started; a matching report.sha256.json is required before measurements appear. Checksum verification establishes artifact integrity, not data acceptance.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "tradebot-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "No report yet",
                  "color": "gray"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Awaiting checksum publication",
                  "color": "orange"
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Checksum verified",
                  "color": "blue"
                },
                "3": {
                  "text": "Invalid or incomplete report",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "No evidence",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "tradebot_gate1_report_state",
          "range": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
